Just move event$ignore() earlier in the handler, like:

mykeypress <- function(layer, event){

  print('do something I want!')

  event$ignore()

  if(match_key('T')){
    hline <<- hline + .2
    qupdate(new)
  }
}

At least, that seemed to get the line to move when I tried it last night.

